window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>My whole life changed overnight. And it's everything I wanted and more.<br> <br> My dark knights thought their shadows would be too much for me, but they're quickly learning that they're not the only ones who’ve kept their deepest desires a secret. <br> <br> Now that we’ve crossed that line, they can't keep their hands off me. I didn't think they could get any more protective, but I was wrong. <br> <br> But with who they are, life is never that simple and never quiet for long.<br> <br> After Leah, one of our guests at Safe Haven, tells us about her horrific past, the guys know what they have to do. And I'm determined to be right there alongside them.<br> <br> In the meantime, while they figure out how to help her, we have fun exploring this new dynamic of our relationship. <br> <br> Sadly, fun can't last forever and monsters need to be slayed.<br> <br> But there's more than one lurking in the shadows. Who are they after and when my guys find out who will survive?</p> <p>This is a dark reverse harem. There is a lot of sensitive subjects and content. Please look at content warning in the book before listening.</p>"; 
